    "title": "White Rock Stables invites neighbors in for healing - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Austin Wood ,\n4 days ago “What did you notice about that exercise? What did you notice about yourself?” White Rock Stables instructor Julie Wilson asks 11-year-old Evie. The exercise in question takes place in a riding ring toward the back of the 14-acre property neighboring Flag Pole Hill Park. Standing a few feet away, Wilson watches on as Evie leads two-year-old Balou, an Irish sport horse standing nearly 16 hands (five feet) tall, across the sand. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 7",
